<title>USA: Siloam Springs, Ark., repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Siloam Springs, Ark., repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Thursday it repriced Siloam Springs, Ark., $3.8 million bond deal, lowering yields five basis points in the 2006 and 2007 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>City of Siloam Springs, Arkansas</p>
<p>RE: $3,835,000*</p>
<p>(Arkansas Electric Cooporation Project)</p>
<p>Series 1997E</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa3		   S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>    DATED: 03/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 06/01 &amp; 12/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		AMOUNT*   AMOUNT*   COUPON     PRICE</p>
<p>			   (6/1)    (12/1)</p>
<p>1997			--	 135M    3.80  %    100.00</p>
<p>1998		     135M	 --     4.00  %    100.00</p>
<p>1998			--	 140M    4.10  %    100.00</p>
<p>1999		     140M	145M    4.20  %	4.30</p>
<p>2000		     155M	160M    4.40  %	4.50</p>
<p>2001		     165M	170M    4.50  %	4.60</p>
<p>2002		     175M	180M    4.60  %	4.70</p>
<p>2003		     185M	195M    4.70  %	4.80</p>
<p>2004		     200M	205M    4.80  %	4.90</p>
<p>2005		     210M	220M    4.90  %	5.00</p>
<p>2006		     220M	225M    5.00  %	5.05</p>
<p>2007		     235M	240M    5.00  %	5.15</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, February 27, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on March 6, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
